CM_ BO_ 199 "Low level BMU control (preconditioning, utility mode activation; involved in start/stop).";
CM_ BO_ 685 "BMS_Precond_Status (0x2AD), Ioniq 5 / EV6. Byte 1 state: Ioniq 5 0x01 idle / 0x05 starting / 0x15 started; EV6 0x41 / 0x45 / 0x55. Ioniq 6 uses the extended ID 0x0A82AA03 instead.";
CM_ BO_ 1261 "Navigation_Precond_Status (0x4ED): navigation distance to charger and precondition flag.";
CM_ BO_ 1096 "Steering-wheel buttons (0x448): star, mode, speak, call, volume, skip, OK buttons.";

